<title>USA: Amoco opens first Mexican convenience store.</title>
<headline>Amoco opens first Mexican convenience store.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amoco Corp said Wednesday it had entered Mexico's consumer market by opening its first convenience service center in Monterrey.</p>
<p>Amoco and partner Fomento Economico Mexicano S.A. de C.V., operating as joint venture company Empresas Amoxxo S.A., opened the Oxxo Express Service Center.</p>
<p>Nine more such combination gas station-convenience store outlets are expected to open by year-end, it said. The joint venture expects to invest more than US$250 million during the next decade.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
